{"4868210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Survival Frontier", "steam_appid": 4868210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Survival Frontier is a third person open area survival shooter where players explore dangerous wastelands, eliminate infected threats, complete objectives, and travel across hostile territories using a variety of vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a survivor armed with powerful weapons and venture into zombie infested zones filled with danger. Fight your way through hordes of infected enemies, secure valuable resources, and push deeper into the frontier as new challenges emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission brings new risks. Every location hides new threats. Survival depends on your aim, strategy, and ability to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities are abandoned, supply routes have collapsed, and vast regions have become overrun by the infected. The remaining survivors are scattered across the frontier, fighting to stay alive in a world consumed by chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontline Insertion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/6b8306cecb1752d461a5e024c5bdf61e.poster.avif?t=1782192196\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/6b8306cecb1752d461a5e024c5bdf61e.webm?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/6b8306cecb1752d461a5e024c5bdf61e.mp4?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy directly into infected territory and begin your mission beyond the last safe zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/2792b1cfc28aba250a776d8576a79738.poster.avif?t=1782192196\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/2792b1cfc28aba250a776d8576a79738.webm?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/2792b1cfc28aba250a776d8576a79738.mp4?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense third person gunfights against infected enemies. Use a variety of weapons to eliminate threats and survive overwhelming attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/c4371127cad9ab0be7fdc3afd7438a0c.poster.avif?t=1782192196\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/c4371127cad9ab0be7fdc3afd7438a0c.webm?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/c4371127cad9ab0be7fdc3afd7438a0c.mp4?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across dangerous regions using abandoned cars, trucks, and other vehicles. Reach new locations and discover hidden areas throughout the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Survival Zones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/4c0f2b8c43c34c7c51a4c776d595d4fe.poster.avif?t=1782192196\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/4c0f2b8c43c34c7c51a4c776d595d4fe.webm?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/4c0f2b8c43c34c7c51a4c776d595d4fe.mp4?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large environments filled with abandoned structures, hostile monster zombies, and unexpected encounters around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/72981cde6d19a5414a63ec0da38e9a6f.poster.avif?t=1782192196\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/72981cde6d19a5414a63ec0da38e9a6f.webm?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/72981cde6d19a5414a63ec0da38e9a6f.mp4?t=1782192196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb ladders and elevated structures to reach new areas, gain tactical advantages, and uncover hidden paths across the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive To Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868210/extras/49c55909c556c24e9bb139d04acc94b1.poster.avif?t=1782192196\" width=426 height=240 ><sourc